#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of the complete \"supported\" mark depends on the column:\n"
msgstr "Arti dari tanda \"didukung\" penuh bergantung pada kolomnya:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: The feature can be parsed by [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (by using the `qiskit-qasm3-import` extension), represented in a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit),\n"
"and exported to OpenQASM 3 by [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps).\n"
msgstr ""
"*Qiskit SDK*: Fitur ini dapat diparse oleh [`qiskit.qasm3.loads`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3) (menggunakan ekstensi `qiskit-qasm3-import`), direpresentasikan dalam sebuah [`QuantumCircuit`,](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)\n"
"dan diekspor ke OpenQASM 3 oleh [`qiskit.qasm3.dumps`.](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm3#dumps)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "*IBM Qiskit Runtime*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM&reg; Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgid "*IBM Quantum Compute Service*: A circuit containing the corresponding Qiskit feature can be successfully executed on hardware through IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "*IBM Qiskit Runtime*: Circuit yang mengandung fitur Qiskit yang bersangkutan dapat dieksekusi dengan sukses pada perangkat keras melalui IBM&reg; Qiskit Runtime.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The meaning of \"partial support\" typically depends on the linked notes.\n"
msgstr "Arti dari \"dukungan sebagian\" biasanya bergantung pada catatan yang ditautkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Qiskit Runtime is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
#| "Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The most common method of submitting circuits to IBM Quantum Compute Service is to create the circuit in the Python-space interface to Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuits constructed and submitted in this manner do not need to be loaded from OpenQASM 3 files into Qiskit SDK.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Cara paling umum untuk mengirimkan circuit ke IBM Qiskit Runtime adalah dengan membuat circuit di antarmuka Python-space ke Qiskit SDK.\n"
"Circuit yang dibuat dan dikirimkan dengan cara ini tidak perlu dimuat dari file OpenQASM 3 ke Qiskit SDK.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"
#| "This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"If you do not use OpenQASM 3 directly yourself, you can safely use features that are supported for representation in Qiskit SDK, export to OpenQASM 3, and submission to IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
"This includes features that cannot be loaded by Qiskit SDK from OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu tidak menggunakan OpenQASM 3 secara langsung, kamu bisa dengan aman menggunakan fitur yang didukung untuk representasi di Qiskit SDK, ekspor ke OpenQASM 3, dan pengiriman ke IBM Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"Ini termasuk fitur yang tidak dapat dimuat oleh Qiskit SDK dari OpenQASM 3.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

